  <entry>
    <title>闭包</title>
    <link href="/2024/12/21/%E9%97%AD%E5%8C%85/"/>
    <url>/2024/12/21/%E9%97%AD%E5%8C%85/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 id="什么是闭包"><a href="#什么是闭包" class="headerlink" title="什么是闭包"></a>什么是闭包</h3><h4 id="一、闭包的概念"><a href="#一、闭包的概念" class="headerlink" title="一、闭包的概念"></a>一、闭包的概念</h4><p>闭包是指有权访问另一个函数作用域的变量的函数。创建闭包的常用方式，就是在一个函数内部创建另一个函数。</p><h4 id="二、怎么实现闭包"><a href="#二、怎么实现闭包" class="headerlink" title="二、怎么实现闭包"></a>二、怎么实现闭包</h4><p>闭包是指一个函数可以访问它定义时所在的词法作用域以及全局作用域中的变量。在<code>JavaScript</code>中，闭包可以通过函数嵌套和变量引用实现。</p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs javascript"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">outerFun</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> outerVar = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;我在outer函数里!&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">innerFun</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) &#123;<br>      <span class="hljs-variable language_">console</span>.<span class="hljs-title function_">log</span>(outerVar);<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> innerFunction;<br>  &#125;<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> innerFn = <span class="hljs-title function_">outerFun</span>();<br>  <span class="hljs-title function_">innerFn</span>(); <span class="hljs-comment">// 输出: 我在outer函数里!</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>具体来说，当内部函数引用外部函数的变量时，外部函数的作用域链将被保留在内存中，以便内部函数可以访问这些变量。</p><p>这种函数嵌套和变量共享的方式就是闭包的核心概念。当一个函数返回另一个函数时，它实际上返回了一个闭包，其中包含了原函数定义时的词法作用域和相关变量。</p><h4 id="三、闭包的用途"><a href="#三、闭包的用途" class="headerlink" title="三、闭包的用途"></a>三、闭包的用途</h4><h5 id="1-封装私有变量"><a href="#1-封装私有变量" class="headerlink" title="1.封装私有变量"></a>1.封装私有变量</h5><p>闭包可以用于封装私有变量，以防止其被外部访问和修改。封装私有变量可以一定程度上防止全局变量污染，使用闭包封装私有变量可以将这些变量限制在函数内部或模块内部，从而减少了全局变量的数量，降低了全局变量被误用或意外修改的风险。</p><h5 id="2-做缓存"><a href="#2-做缓存" class="headerlink" title="2. 做缓存"></a>2. 做缓存</h5><p>函数一旦被执行完毕，其内存就会被销毁，而闭包的存在，就可以保有内部环境的作用域。</p><h4 id="四、闭包的缺点"><a href="#四、闭包的缺点" class="headerlink" title="四、闭包的缺点"></a>四、闭包的缺点</h4><p>闭包也存在着一个潜在的问题，由于闭包会引用外部函数的变量，但是这些变量在外部函数执行完毕后没有被释放，那么这些变量会一直存在于内存中，总的内存大小不变，但是可用内存空间变小了。 一旦形成闭包，只有在页面关闭后，闭包占用的内存才会被回收，就会造成的内存泄漏。</p><p>因此我们在使用闭包时需要特别注意内存泄漏的问题，可以用以下两种方法解决内存泄露问题：</p><ol><li>及时释放闭包：手动调用闭包函数，并将其返回值赋值为null，这样可以让闭包中的变量及时被垃圾回收器回收。</li><li>使用立即执行函数：在创建闭包时，将需要保留的变量传递给一个立即执行函数，并将这些变量作为参数传递给闭包函数，这样可以保留所需的变量，而不会导致其他变量的内存泄漏。</li></ol>]]></content>
    
    
    
    <tags>
      
      <tag>JavaScript</tag>
      
    </tags>
    
  </entry>
  
  
  
  <entry>
    <title>字符串的输入输出</title>
    <link href="/2024/12/21/%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA/"/>
    <url>/2024/12/21/%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="字符串的输入"><a href="#字符串的输入" class="headerlink" title="字符串的输入"></a>字符串的输入</h2><p>对于字符串的输入，为了避免scanf不能读入空格等空字符的问题，可用如下输入方法：</p><h3 id="一、getchar-循环法输入"><a href="#一、getchar-循环法输入" class="headerlink" title="一、getchar()循环法输入"></a>一、getchar()循环法输入</h3><p>可以直接用getchar()函数（用于输入单个字符），并且借助while循环来进行输入字符串。输入的字符串以单个字符的形式一个个存储在数组单元中。接着遍历输出数组中的元素就可以输出字符串。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> str[<span class="hljs-number">100</span>];<span class="hljs-comment">//定义了一个长度为100（也就是最大可容纳99个字符和一个字符串结束标志\0）的字符数组，注意接下来输入的字符串长度不要越界</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> i=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span>((str[i]=getchar())!=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>)<span class="hljs-comment">//getchar()函数一次只能输入一个字符，本条件的设置是让getchar()读入回车键\n之前，都读入一个字符进入str数组</span><br>    &#123;<br>        i++;<span class="hljs-comment">//读入一个字符后移向下一位继续读</span><br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;j&lt;i;j++)<span class="hljs-comment">//借助for循环将字符一个一个地输出形成字符串</span><br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>,str[j]);<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="二、gets-s-直接输入"><a href="#二、gets-s-直接输入" class="headerlink" title="二、gets_s()直接输入"></a>二、gets_s()直接输入</h3><p>可以直接用gets_s()函数（用于输入字符串）</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span><br>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-type">char</span> str[<span class="hljs-number">100</span>];<span class="hljs-comment">//定义了一个长度为100（也就是最大可容纳99个字符和一个字符串结束标志\0）的字符数组，注意接下来输入的字符串长度不要越界</span><br>gets_s(str,<span class="hljs-number">100</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//前者为你要输入的字符串的存储的数组名，后者是你输入字符串的最大长度</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;j&lt;i;j++)<span class="hljs-comment">//借助for循环将字符一个一个地输出形成字符串</span><br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>,str[j]);<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="三、fgets-直接输入"><a href="#三、fgets-直接输入" class="headerlink" title="三、fgets()直接输入"></a>三、fgets()直接输入</h3><p>可以直接用fgets()函数（用于输入字符串）</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span><br>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-type">char</span> str[<span class="hljs-number">100</span>];<span class="hljs-comment">//定义了一个长度为100（也就是最大可容纳99个字符和一个字符串结束标志\0）的字符数组，注意接下来输入的字符串长度不要越界</span><br>fgets(str,<span class="hljs-number">100</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">stdin</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//前者为你要输入的字符串的存储的数组名，中间是你输入字符串的最大长度，最后为一个宏定义</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;j&lt;i;j++)<span class="hljs-comment">//借助for循环将字符一个一个地输出形成字符串</span><br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>,str[j]);<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="fgets-函数和gets-s-都是用于输入字符的函数，二者的不同之处都有什么呢？"><a href="#fgets-函数和gets-s-都是用于输入字符的函数，二者的不同之处都有什么呢？" class="headerlink" title="*fgets()函数和gets_s()都是用于输入字符的函数，二者的不同之处都有什么呢？"></a>*fgets()函数和gets_s()都是用于输入字符的函数，二者的不同之处都有什么呢？</h3><ol><li><p>fgets()函数使用时需要3个参数，第一个是需要存入字符串的数组名，第二个是需要输入的字符串的字符最大个数（不能数组越界），第三个是一个宏定义“stdin”（不可省略，否则报错）；</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>fgets(a,<span class="hljs-number">10</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">stdin</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//第二个可以是不超过10的任意自然数</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>gets_s()函数使用时只需要两个参数，第一个是需要存入字符串的数组名，第二个是需要输入的字符串的字符最大个数（不能数组越界）。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>gets_s(a,<span class="hljs-number">10</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr></li><li><p>gets_s()函数不够保险。</p><p>（1）当你的字符串最大长度设置的小于数组长度时，如下：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>gets_s(a,<span class="hljs-number">5</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>当你在输入时若你输入小于5字符的字符串，你输入的字符串会被存入数组，按下回车的同时，gets_s()函数只会将你输入的字符末位的下一位赋值为’\0’，a[10]剩余元素不做操作。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abc”，数组此时为：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\? //显示?是因为数组未初始化</span><br><span class="hljs-string">a[5] = &#x27;</span>\?<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\?</span><br><span class="hljs-string">a[7] = &#x27;</span>\?<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\?</span><br><span class="hljs-string">a[9] = &#x27;</span>\?<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>而若你输入多于或等于5字符的字符串，gets_s()会直接报错</strong>，因为字符串最后一位’\0’超出第二个参数设置的最大字符串长度。</p><p>（2）当你的字符串最大长度设置的恰等于数组长度时，如下：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>gets_s(a,<span class="hljs-number">10</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>当你在输入时若你输入小于10字符的字符串，你输入的字符串会被存入数组，按下回车的同时，gets_s()会将你字符末位的下一位赋值为’\0’，a[10]剩余元素不做操作。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abcde”，数组此时为：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = d<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = e<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\?  //显示?是因为数组未初始化</span><br><span class="hljs-string">a[7] = &#x27;</span>\?<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\?</span><br><span class="hljs-string">a[9] = &#x27;</span>\?<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>而若你输入多于或等于10字符的字符串，gets_s()会直接报错</strong>，因为字符串最后一位’\0’不仅超出gets_s()第二个参数设置的最大字符串长度，也超过了数组长度。</p><hr></li><li><p>fgets()函数对于数组及输入有更为保险的操作。</p><p>（1）当你的字符串最大长度设置的小于数组长度时，如下：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>fgets(a,<span class="hljs-number">5</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">stdin</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>当你在输入时若你输入小于5字符的字符串，你输入的字符串会被存入数组，按下回车的同时，fgets()会将你输入的字符末位的下一位赋值为’\n’（仅限于字符串长度小于第二个参数时），a[10]的剩余元素全部赋值为’\0’，即使数组未初始化。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abc”，数组此时为：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">9</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>而若你输入多于或等于5字符的字符串，fgets()会在第5个字符处截断你输入的字符串。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abcde”，数组中此时为:</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = d<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">9</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>若你输入”abcdefg”，数组中此时也为:</p><figure class="highlight stylus"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs stylus"><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[0]</span> = <span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[1]</span> = <span class="hljs-selector-tag">b</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[2]</span> = c<br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[3]</span> = d<br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[4]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[5]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[6]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[7]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[8]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-selector-tag">a</span><span class="hljs-selector-attr">[9]</span> = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>（2）当你的字符串最大长度设置的恰等于数组长度时，如下：</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>fgets(a,<span class="hljs-number">10</span>,<span class="hljs-built_in">stdin</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>当你在输入时若你输入小于10字符的字符串，你输入的字符串会被存入数组，按下回车的同时，fgets()会将你字符末位的下一位赋值为’\n’（仅限于字符串长度小于第二个参数时），a[10]的剩余元素全部赋值为’\0’。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abcde”，数组中此时为:</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = d<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = e<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br>a[<span class="hljs-number">9</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>而若你输入多于或等于10字符的字符串，fgets()会在第10个字符处截断你输入的字符串。</p><p>也就是说若你输入”abcdefghik”，数组中此时为:</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = d<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = e<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = f<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = g<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>] = h<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = i<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">9</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>若你输入”abcdefghiklmn”，数组中此时也为:</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c">a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] = a<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>] = b<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>] = c<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>] = d<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] = e<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>] = f<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">6</span>] = g<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">7</span>] = h<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">8</span>] = i<br>a[<span class="hljs-number">9</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>fgets()函数不必担心超过你函数内设置的最大长度，因为它会帮你截断，只要不超过数组长度，一切都是安全的。</p></li></ol><h2 id="字符串的输出"><a href="#字符串的输出" class="headerlink" title="字符串的输出"></a>字符串的输出</h2><p>通过上述方法将字符串存储进str数组后，需要将其中的元素输出形成字符串，可采用下列方法：</p><h3 id="一、for循环-printf-putchar-遍历输出"><a href="#一、for循环-printf-putchar-遍历输出" class="headerlink" title="一、for循环+printf()&#x2F;putchar()遍历输出"></a>一、for循环+printf()&#x2F;putchar()遍历输出</h3><p>该方法也就是上面演示字符串输入方法的输出部分，此方法虽然语句较为繁琐，但是使用比较灵活。可以通过改变for语句内的条件来随意输出任意位置开始的字符串，也可以通过此方法可以逆序输出字符串。缺点是只能搭配getchar()循环法来界定字符串结束点。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;j&lt;i;j++)<span class="hljs-comment">//此处i表示字符串的终点，是通过getchar()循环法来记录的</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%c&quot;</span>,str[j]);<span class="hljs-comment">//一个一个字符地输出，形成字符串</span><br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(j=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;j&lt;i;j++)<span class="hljs-comment">//此处i表示字符串的终点，是通过getchar()循环法来记录的</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">putchar</span>(str[j]);<span class="hljs-comment">//一个一个字符地输出，形成字符串</span><br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>*对于putchar()和printf()的区别：</p><p>putchar ()函数只能输出单个字符，而printf()函数可以输出各种类型的数据，例如字符型、浮点型、整数型；“printf (“%c”,’A’)”相当于“putchar (‘A’)”，如果只想输出一个字符，putchar ()较好用</p><h3 id="二、printf-puts-直接输出"><a href="#二、printf-puts-直接输出" class="headerlink" title="二、printf()&#x2F;puts()直接输出"></a>二、printf()&#x2F;puts()直接输出</h3><p>除了上面的for循环的遍历数组一个一个的输出，也可以直接以字符串形式输出。此方法更加简单暴力一些，但是一输出就是整个字符串，不能从中间特定位置输出或者逆序输出，不如for循环一个个输出来的灵活。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s\n&quot;</span>,str);<span class="hljs-comment">//利用printf()直接输出存储在str中的字符串</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-built_in">puts</span>(str);<span class="hljs-comment">//利用puts()直接输出存储在str中的字符串</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>puts()函数的输出自带换行，不像printf()需要加’\n’。puts()对于printf()来说也只是一种专门输出字符型变量的函数。printf()终究是功能更强大些。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
