    <title>指针探究</title>
    <link href="/2024/12/21/%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/"/>
    <url>/2024/12/21/%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E6%8E%A2%E7%A9%B6/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="普通指针"><a href="#普通指针" class="headerlink" title="普通指针"></a>普通指针</h2><h3 id="一、指针的操作原理"><a href="#一、指针的操作原理" class="headerlink" title="一、指针的操作原理"></a>一、指针的操作原理</h3><p>指针就是地址。指针的作用像是一个遥控器。</p><p>当创建了一个指针变量时，最好进行初始化，要么让它指向你定义的一个变量，要么给它赋值为NULL。</p><p>不初始化的指针是很危险的，当不初始化时，指针会指向一个随机的地址，它可能指向电脑禁止人们操作的内存。所以定义指针变量一定要初始化。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-comment">//第一种初始化方法</span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p = &amp;a;<span class="hljs-comment">//$为取地址符号</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-comment">//第二种初始化方法</span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p = <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>int* 修饰了p这个变量，这使得变量p变为指针变量。以后，p就是地址，也只能存储地址，只能将别的变量的地址赋值给p。<strong>一个变量赋值给p后，我们称指针p指向了这个变量</strong>。看第一种初始化方法吧，p此时指向了a，p存储了a的地址，就像遥控器和电视配对了一样，你可以通过对p操作来对a进行一些改变了。详见下下个代码块的内容。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p = &amp;a;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;p = %p\n&quot;</span>,p);<span class="hljs-comment">//输出结果为p存储的一个地址</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&amp;a = %p\n&quot;</span>,&amp;a);<span class="hljs-comment">//输出结果为a的地址</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>以上发现二者输出结果相同，均为a的地址。</p><p>如下对p指向a后进行了详细探究</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span><br>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//给a一个初始值0</span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p = &amp;a;<span class="hljs-comment">//将a的地址赋给p,将a的地址存储的值（也就是a的初始值）赋给了*p</span><br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, &amp;a);<span class="hljs-comment">//输出结果为a的地址</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a);<span class="hljs-comment">//输出结果为a的值</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, *p);<span class="hljs-comment">//*p此时为a的值</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, p);<span class="hljs-comment">//p此时为a的地址</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;***************************************************************************************\n&quot;</span>);<br>*p += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//此时对*p进行了+1操作，观察a的地址，a的值，*p的值，p的值有何变化</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, &amp;a);<span class="hljs-comment">//a的地址不发生改变</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a);<span class="hljs-comment">//a的值加了一</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, *p);<span class="hljs-comment">//*p的值也加了1</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, p);<span class="hljs-comment">//p仍是a的地址</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;***************************************************************************************\n&quot;</span>);<br>p += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//对p进行+1操作</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, &amp;a);<span class="hljs-comment">//a的地址不发生改变</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, a); <span class="hljs-comment">//a的值不发生改变</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, *p);<span class="hljs-comment">//*p因为p的操作改变</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>, p);<span class="hljs-comment">//p的值加了4字节，因为这是int型指针，对其操作时会根据不同指针类型而有不同的改变量。char型+1只增加1字节，double型增加8字节</span><br>    <br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对于* p这个指针变量来说，* p此时指向了变量a的内存空间</p><p>p存储了变量a的地址，* p存储了变量a的值</p><p>p&#x3D;&#x3D;&a;     *p&#x3D;&#x3D;a;</p><p>并且可以直接通过对*p进行操作来改变a的值，而对p操作没法改变a的地址 </p><p>当把指针指向某个变量时，变量类型必须和指针类型相同。</p><h3 id="二、指针的运算"><a href="#二、指针的运算" class="headerlink" title="二、指针的运算"></a>二、指针的运算</h3><p>指针作为一种变量，也是可以进行运算的。可进行的运算有：</p><p>(1) 对一个指针执行整数加法和减法操作。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a=<span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p=&amp;a;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p&quot;</span>,p);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p&quot;</span>,p+<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>发现打印出来的两地址恰相差4字节，这是因为指针p为int类型。</p><p>如果是char型指针，+1会相差1字节。</p><p>如果是double型指针，+1会相差8字节。</p><p>(2) 两个指针相减。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>]=&#123;<span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#125;;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* p=&amp;a[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>];<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span>* q=&amp;a[<span class="hljs-number">5</span>];<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>,p);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%p\n&quot;</span>,q);<br><span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>,q-p);<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>分别输出p和q的地址，发现正好相差（5-1）* 4&#x3D;16个字节，而让q-p，输出结果并不是两地址的差值，而是4，也就是两个指针所指数组元素之间相差了几个元素。</p><p>当将两个指针相减时，这两个指针必须具有相同的基本类型，但是类型限定符则不需要一样。</p><p>假设有两个指针 p_1 和 p_2，它们都指向数组 a 内的元素：</p><p>如果 p_1 指向数组元素 a[i]，并且 n 是一个整数，那么表达式 p_2&#x3D;p_1+n 的使得 p_2 指向数组元素 a[i+n]。</p><p>(3) 比较两个指针。</p><p>假设有两个指针 p 和 q，它们都指向数组 a 内的元素：</p><p>若p指向a[1]，q指向a[2]，那么p&lt;q即为真。</p><h2 id="指针和数组"><a href="#指针和数组" class="headerlink" title="指针和数组"></a>指针和数组</h2><h3 id="一、数组与指针的关系"><a href="#一、数组与指针的关系" class="headerlink" title="一、数组与指针的关系"></a>一、数组与指针的关系</h3><p>数组实质上是一种特殊的指针（目前看来）。数组名是该数组首元素的地址，是一个常量，不可以进行++&#x2F;–运算。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>];<br>a++;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如上是一种错误写法，a是常量，不可修改。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span><span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span><br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> a[<span class="hljs-number">10</span>]=&#123;<span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#125;;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;a = %p\n&quot;</span>,a);<span class="hljs-comment">//以地址形式输出a</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;&amp;a[0] = %p\n&quot;</span>,&amp;a[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]);<span class="hljs-comment">//输出a[0]的地址</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如上，运行结果发现输出的地址相同，也就印证了a&#x3D;&#x3D;&amp;a[0]。</p><p>其他具体可参照下面网站的内容：</p><p>(<a href="http://c.biancheng.net/view/1993.html">http://c.biancheng.net/view/1993.html</a>)</p><h3 id="二、指针数组"><a href="#二、指针数组" class="headerlink" title="二、指针数组"></a>二、指针数组</h3><p>指针数组就是一个数组，其中每个元素都是指针。</p><h3 id="三、数组指针"><a href="#三、数组指针" class="headerlink" title="三、数组指针"></a>三、数组指针</h3><p>数组指针是一种指针，专门用来指向数组。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    
